---
// A 2x2 for AI features: how differentiating it is vs. how fast you need it.
---
<svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 480 360" role="img" aria-label="Build versus buy matrix: build what differentiates you, buy what is commodity, partner when you need speed on something core">
  <path class="ln" d="M80 300 L440 300" />
  <path class="ln" d="M80 300 L80 40" />
  <path class="ln faint dash" d="M260 40 L260 300 M80 170 L440 170" />
  <text class="t-sm" x="260" y="328" text-anchor="middle">how fast you need it →</text>
  <text class="t-sm" x="40" y="170" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 40 170)">how much it sets you apart →</text>
  <rect class="node-gold" x="100" y="58" width="140" height="94" rx="10" />
  <text class="t-lg t-gold" x="170" y="100" text-anchor="middle">build</text>
  <text class="t-sm" x="170" y="122" text-anchor="middle">your moat</text>
  <rect class="node-teal" x="280" y="58" width="140" height="94" rx="10" />
  <text class="t-lg" x="350" y="100" text-anchor="middle">partner</text>
  <text class="t-sm" x="350" y="122" text-anchor="middle">core, but urgent</text>
  <rect class="node" x="100" y="188" width="140" height="94" rx="10" />
  <text class="t-lg" x="170" y="230" text-anchor="middle">wait</text>
  <text class="t-sm" x="170" y="252" text-anchor="middle">not worth it yet</text>
  <rect class="node" x="280" y="188" width="140" height="94" rx="10" />
  <text class="t-lg" x="350" y="230" text-anchor="middle">buy</text>
  <text class="t-sm" x="350" y="252" text-anchor="middle">commodity</text>
</svg>
